# Frontend design

Read and follow `.cursor/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md` before changing UI.

Emulocke visual direction is **locked field kit**: charcoal metal, inset glass screens, one deep crimson accent, tabular/technical type. Not stock ImGui gray. Not purple gradients. Not Inter/Roboto/Arial/system UI fonts.

Screens sit in bezels. The suite pane is an empty expedition log until that product exists. Integer-scale nearest-neighbor for emulator pixels. No scanlines. No fake tracker widgets.
